# Tells wrangler's static-assets uploader which paths under this directory
# are NOT site assets and should never be uploaded — without this it walks
# literally everything on disk, including .git's pack files (100+ MiB,
# over the 25 MiB per-asset limit) and the unrelated capacitor-app/ mobile
# project and its node_modules.
.git
.wrangler
capacitor-app
.DS_Store
backups
Claude outputs

# Raw video masters + build outputs (never served directly — see .gitignore,
# same exclusion) added Sep 4 2026 after a deploy failed on a 134MiB .mov here.
Mosaic/*/raw

# Deploy scripts + the live-deploy passphrase gate (Sep 12 2026) — the .sh
# files contain no secrets but have no reason to be publicly downloadable
# from the live site either; the passphrase file is already gitignored, this
# is defense in depth in case it's ever present on disk unexpectedly.
deploy-live.sh
set-live-deploy-passphrase.sh
.live_deploy_passphrase
